 "lead_html": "<p><b>Pick per row: accept or redo.</b> Four canon Jedi: Fallen Order variants of RSW_Dragonsnake. No white variants (owner 2026-10-18); the white serpent is the separate Albino.</p><p><b>Must show</b> (brief): long low crocodilian QUADRUPED with short splayed clawed legs and a very long tapering eel-like tail; narrow toothy gharial snout with fangs outside the jaw; dark olive-to-slate scaly hide, pale ridged belly; dorsal row of short spines; realistic wet hide, no outlines, no cartoon shading. NOT pale or limbless; not tan/khaki.</p><p>Concept image: design/RimStarWars/canon_references/dragonsnake/wookieepedia_concept_jfo.jpg (shown beside each row).</p>"
